2025-09-08 09:33:36.8403 INFO Email Sent - Subject: Truv Credentialing Order Notification [1010508536-02] 
2025-09-08 09:33:36.8403 INFO Email Notification Sent: Truv Credentialing Order Notification [1010508536-02] 
2025-09-08 09:33:36.8403 INFO This is an alert from the VOE Team that your Borrower, Peter Campbell Roden, with Fairfax County Public Schools, 1010508536-02, has received an email to connect to their payroll provider in an attempt to participate in the First Home/ Truv VOE Credentialing Process. This order has been selected because their information met the below criteria:

* Current Employment
* Employed for 2+ years
* Initial VOE

Please be advised this order will pend for a total of 24 hours prior to moving to the next step in the VOE process. The Borrower will receive three reminder emails within those 24 hours to connect if they have not already done so. If the Borrower successfully connects to their payroll provider and receives sufficient data for the VOE, the order will be approved. If there are issues such as the ones listed below the order will automatically move to the next step in the VOE process.

* Borrower cannot locate payroll company in Truv platform
* Borrower fails to connect
* Borrower has connectivity issues
* Employer is not supported/ uses another 3rd party vendor
* Borrower connected, however, payroll provider was unable to provide sufficient data for the VOE

Please refer to the training materials and flyer attached if you have any questions. You may also view the progress of your order through the VOE pipeline in Encompass.

Thank you,

Sincerely,
First Home Mortgage Verification Team
6211 Greenleigh Avenue, Suite 300, Baltimore MD 21220  

(For questions or concerns on the status of your VOE please check the VOE pipeline at http://aze-app-1v/voesystem/pipeline)



